# Secrets for the cf-orbs Worker. The Deploy to Cloudflare setup page reads this file.
# Both secrets are set on the Worker after the deploy by: npx cf-orbs init --no-deploy --adopt
# Uncomment a line and paste a value only to set that secret at deploy time.

# Bearer token for the cf-orbs control API. Generate one: openssl rand -hex 32
# CONTROL_TOKEN=

# Your Amp provider token (aop_live_…), from Amp Settings → Orbs → Add Provider
# AMP_ORB_PROVIDER_TOKEN=
